{"msg":"操作成功!","data":{"guideTitle":"手写笔1.0（电容笔）使用攻略","guideId":18,"guideContent":"<div class=\"mb-32 text-blue\">适用于：Q20、X3 Pro、X2Pro、X2、Z1型号</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">1.【电池拆装】</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">拧开笔帽，正极朝下安装（如图所示）</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_1_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">2.【笔芯拆装】</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        随机配置一个笔芯和一个备用笔尖，可以自行安装更换，请使用笔芯拆装器夹住笔芯拔出，拔出之后再将备用笔芯安装进去即可（如图所示）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_2_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_3_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_4_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">3.【按键说明】</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        1）下按键：电子橡皮擦<br />\n        书写时按住下按键，可以变成橡皮擦模式，直接擦除线条<br />\n        2）上按键：AI快捷符号<br />\n        收藏题目：按住上按键在题目界面画一个五角星，可以快捷收藏题目。（如图所示）\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_5_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/answerPen10/pic_6_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        批改笔：在需要自主批改的时候，按住上按键直接在屏幕书写对勾✅叉号❎半对，可以快捷批改题目。\n      </div>"},"status":0}